        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSPBB1810, Contemporary Stainless Steel Back-to-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back 18 Inch Contemporary Pulls comes packaged as a set including 2 pulls and the mounting hardware required to install them on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This Stainless Steel Door Handle Pair is available in brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or matte black finishes. It has an 18 inch center to center length and a 19 inch overall length. This Contemporary Stainless Steel Back-to-Back Door Pull Set will add a modern touch to any door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSPBB1810-specifications.gif?v=1704354538\" width=\"600\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSPBB1810 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available as an individual <a href=\"/products/18-inch-contemporary-pull-deltana-ssp1810\"><b>Deltana SSP1810 Contemporary 18\" Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle Back to Back Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-7/8\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Screws: 8 mm x 1.25 mm</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSPBB1810-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262342\"><b>Deltana SSPBB1810 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting</b>.\r\n</p>",
