                "title": "Back-to-Back 18 Inch Contemporary Pulls",
                "description": "The Back-to-Back 18 Inch Contemporary Pulls comes packaged as a set including 2 pulls and the mounting hardware required to install them on wood, glass, or metal doors. This Stainless Steel Door Handle Pair is available in brushed stainless steel, polished stainless steel, or matte black finishes. It has an 18 inch center to center length and a 19 inch overall length. This Contemporary Stainless Steel Back-to-Back Door Pull Set will add a modern touch to any door.",
